msgstr "無"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td:6685-8
msgid "On auto night mode activation"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:6686-8
msgid ""
"Run this profile every time the <b>Night Mode</b> (inverted screen color) is "
"toggled or screen warmth is changed"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td:6687-80
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:6688-8
msgid ""
"This trigger will activate on <b>every warmth change</b>. You can limit this "
"by enabling the <span class=\"ui\">Only within time interval</span> option."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6695-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Profile auto-execution"
msgid "Profile auto-execution examples:"
msgstr "自動套用設定檔"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6697-6
msgid ""
"Here are some profile examples from our devs to give you ideas about using "
"this powerful feature of KOReader. Examples also include auto-execute "
"conditions and <span class=\"ui\">collections</span> features:"
msgstr ""
"以下是我們的開發人員提供的設定檔範例，希望能讓你對 KOReader 這項強大功能的用"
"法有些靈感。這些範例也包含自動套用條件與<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>功"
"能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6701-7
msgid ""
"Enable <b>two columns mode</b> when you turn your device to landscape "
"orientation."
msgstr "將裝置轉為橫向時啟用<b>雙欄模式</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6703-7
msgid "Enable <b>night mode</b> when you turn your device upside down."
msgstr "將裝置倒置時啟用<b>夜間模式</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6705-7
msgid ""
"Add all your manga to a collection. Then create a profile which switches the "
"page turn direction to <b>Right-To-Left</b> and inverts the page turn taps "
"and swipes when you open a manga book from this collection."
msgstr ""
"將所有漫畫加入同一個收藏清單，然後建立一個設定檔，在開啟該收藏清單中的漫畫"
"時，把翻頁方向改為<b>從右向左</b>，並對調左右兩側的翻頁點選與滑動手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6707-7
msgid ""
"Add your comic books to a collection, which can trigger a profile to "
"decrease the screen refresh interval to <span class=\"ui\">every page</span> "
"to avoid ghosting."
msgstr ""
"把你的漫畫書加入一個收藏清單，就能透過這個條件觸發設定檔，將螢幕重新整理間隔"
"縮短為<span class=\"ui\">每一頁</span>，以避免殘影。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6709-7
msgid ""
"Trigger a profile to adjust typeface, font size and set two-column mode when "
"opening a file for the first time from the <b>Periodicals</b> folder."
msgstr ""
"首次從<b>期刊</b>資料夾開啟檔案時，觸發設定檔來調整字型與字型大小，並設定雙欄"
"模式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6711-7
msgid ""
"Add your problematic PDFs to a collection, so when you open them <span "
"class=\"ui\">Auto OCR</span> or <span class=\"ui\">Reflow mode</span> is "
"activated with a profile."
msgstr ""
"將有問題的 PDF 檔案加入一個收藏清單，這樣在開啟這些檔案時，就能透過設定檔啟用"
"<span class=\"ui\">自動 OCR</span>或<span class=\"ui\">重新排版模式</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6714-7
msgid ""
"Switch display mode (covers, detailed list etc.) of <span class=\"ui\">file "
"browser</span> when you enter certain folders."
msgstr ""
"在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中開啟特定資料夾時，切換顯示模式（封"
"面、詳細清單等）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6716-7
msgid ""
"Toggle off reading statistics when opening a book from a <b>Reference Books</"
"b> collection. Toggle statistics back on when closing the book."
msgstr ""
"開啟「<b>參考類書籍</b>」收藏清單中的書籍時停用閱讀統計，並在關閉書籍時重新啟"
"用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6718-7
msgid ""
"If you expose the <span class=\"ui\">style tweaks</span> in the gesture "
"manager, you can create a profile to enable or disable them based on certain "
"conditions. For example you can trigger a <b>\"disable publisher styles AND "
"apply my user style tweaks\"</b> profile based on the book's location/"
"collection or by a keyword in the metadata of the book. See the <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-styletweaks\">Style Tweaks</a> section of "
"the guide for more info."
msgstr ""
"如果你在手勢管理員中開放了<span class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>項目，就能建立設"
"定檔，依特定條件啟用或停用這些調整。例如，你可以建立一個<b>「停用出版商樣式，"
"並套用我的自訂樣式調整」</b>的設定檔，並根據書籍的存放位置／收藏清單，或書籍"
"詮釋資料中的關鍵字來觸發。詳細說明請參閱使用手冊的<a href=\"#L2-"
"styletweaks\">樣式微調</a>一節。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6724-6
msgid "Execute profile actions one by one"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6726-6
msgid ""
"Normally when you execute a profile, <b>all of the actions</b> in the "
"profile are executed following the order that you have chosen in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Arrange actions</span> menu."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6730-6
msgid ""
"But you also have the option to execute them <b>one by one</b>. Which means, "
"each time you invoke this profile, <b>only one of the actions (next one)</b> "
"will be executed instead of all of them."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6733-6
msgid "Here is a useful example:"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6736-7
msgid "Create a profile with these actions"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:6738-9
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+qmandprofiles.ol.li.ul.li:393-3"
msgid "Go to pinned page"
msgstr "前往釘選頁面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:6739-9
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+qmandprofiles.ol.li.ul.li:394-3"
msgid "Go back to previous location"
msgstr "返回前一位置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6742-7
msgid ""
"Assign it to an easy gesture like <span class=\"ui\">Tap bottom right "
"corner</span>"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6744-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Activate</span> menu item and then tap <span "
#| "class=\"ui\">According to the sun's position</span>"
msgid ""
"Enable <span class=\"ui\">Execute one by one</span> option from the "
"profile's <span class=\"ui\">Edit actions</span> menu"
msgstr ""
"點選<span class=\"ui\">啟用</span>，然後點選<span class=\"ui\">根據太陽方位切"
"換</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6749-6
msgid ""
"Now each time you tap the right corner, you will switch between your "
"<b>pinned page</b> and your reading position. This can be useful for quickly "
"jumping to <b>references section</b> and going back, for example."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6753-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Profile auto-execution"
msgid "Profile troubleshooting"
msgstr "自動套用設定檔"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6755-6
msgid ""
"Profiles are auto-executed with a tiny delay to avoid interference with "
"other operations/events of KOReader. But in some cases like <b>closing a "
"document</b>, profile has to be executed instantly to be able to perform its "
"actions."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6757-6
msgid "You can enable this instant execution option from:"
msgstr "若要啟用該功能，請按照下列路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6759-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
#| "style=\"width:22px;\"> / Profiles / New with current document settings"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Profiles / \"Your profile name\" / Auto-execute / "
"Execute promptly"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定檔 / 使用目前文件設定新增"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6762-6
msgid ""
"When you enable this option, for example on a profile with the trigger <span "
"class=\"ui\">on book closing</span>, your profile will be executed "
"<b>before</b> the document is closed. This running order is necessary for "
"proper execution in this case."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6765-6
msgid ""
"Whenever you enable <span class=\"ui\">Auto-execute</span> for a profile, we "
"suggest enabling this <span class=\"ui\">Execute promptly</span> option too. "
"If you observe that your profile is not working correctly, then you can try "
"disabling this option."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6769-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> This setting may "
"also cause (unknown) issues, because the number of action combinations in a "
"profile is almost infinite and we don't know how they might interact. This "
"is why it doesn't come enabled by <b>default</b>."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6772-6
msgid ""
"Technical details of Profiles and Quick Menu <span class=\"microns_warning\" "
"title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6774-6
msgid ""
"In KOReader we have <b>a set of actions/settings</b> and this set can be "
"created in two ways:"
msgstr "在 KOReader 中，<b>一組操作／設定</b>可以用兩種方式建立："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6778-7
msgid ""
"As a profile (which is explained as the <span class=\"ui\">Advanced Method</"
"span> and stored in <span class=\"ui\">settings/profiles.lua</span>)"
msgstr ""
"以設定檔的形式建立（也就是前面說的<span class=\"ui\">高階方式</span>，儲存於 "
"<span class=\"ui\">settings/profiles.lua</span>）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6780-7
msgid ""
"As a list of actions assigned to a gesture (which is explained as the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Easy Method</span> and stored in <span class=\"ui\">settings/"
"gestures.lua)</span>"
msgstr ""
"以指定給某個手勢的操作清單形式建立（也就是前面說的<span class=\"ui\">簡單方式"
"</span>，儲存於 <span class=\"ui\">settings/gestures.lua</span>）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6784-6
msgid "This set can also be <b>executed</b> in two different ways:"
msgstr "操作組合也可以透過兩種不同的方式<b>執行</b>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6787-7
msgid ""
"Applying each action in the (sorted) order when triggered (as a <span "
"class=\"ui\">Profile</span>)"
msgstr ""
"觸發後依照排序順序逐項套用每個操作（作為<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:6788-7
msgid "Showing it as a <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span>"
msgstr "顯示為<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6791-6
msgid ""
"Adding/removing actions of a set and enabling/sorting <span "
"class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span> are done via the same <span "
"class=\"ui\">actions menu</span>. The only difference is that the actions "
"menu in the Gesture manager has two more items (Pass through), that is why "
"<span class=\"ui\">Show as Quick Menu</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Sort</"
"span> items are on the second page."
msgstr ""
"新增/刪除一組操作，以及啟用/排序<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>，都是透過"
"同一個<span class=\"ui\">操作選單</span>完成。唯一的差別是，手勢管理員中的操"
"作選單多了兩個項目（穿透），因此<span class=\"ui\">顯示為快速選單</span>和"
"<span class=\"ui\">排序</span>這兩個項目才會在第二頁。"

